---
const skills = ["Kali Linux", "Metasploit", "Burp Suite", "Wireshark", "Python", "Bash", "Docker", "AWS"];
---

<section id="about" class="min-h-screen py-24 px-6 relative flex items-center">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="mb-16">
      <div class="inline-block mb-4">
        <span class="text-primary font-mono text-sm font-semibold">$ cat about.txt</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-foreground">
        About <span class="gradient-text">Me</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-lg text-foreground/90 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-mono">
          Passionate about exploring the depths of cybersecurity and the endless possibilities of Linux systems. 
          I specialize in identifying vulnerabilities, hardening systems, and building secure infrastructure.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6 font-mono">
          When I'm not breaking into systems (ethically, of course), you'll find me contributing to open-source 
          projects, writing security tools, or deep-diving into kernel exploits and reverse engineering.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {skills.map((skill) => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-sm font-mono bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/25 rounded font-medium">
              {skill}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 bg-card/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-border/80 rounded-xl terminal-border shadow-sm">
        <div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span>
            <div>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">Role:</span>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium ml-2">Security Researcher</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span>
            <div>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">Focus:</span>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium ml-2">Offensive Security</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span>
            <div>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">OS:</span>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium ml-2">Arch Linux / Kali</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span>
            <div>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">Editor:</span>
              <span class="text-foreground font-medium ml-2">Neovim</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
